natsuki<smile>: "Mine's the bow at the start." || 私はね、最初の礼。  #c1_0276
kohei(surprised): "The bow?" || 礼って？  #c1_0277
natsuki<wistful>: "Six new schools. Every dojo bows the same way." || 新しい学校は、これで六つ目。でも、どこの道場でも、礼は同じなんだ。  #c1_0278
natsuki<laugh>: "Also, you get to yell in a room full of people and nobody calls your parents." || それに、大勢の前で思いっきり叫んでも、誰にも親を呼ばれないし。  #c1_0279
> She props her chin on her hand and looks me over. Shoulders. Hands. Like she's working out my reach.  #c1_0175
natsuki<curious>: "Do you always sit this straight?" || いつもそんなに背筋伸ばして座ってるの？  #c1_0261
kohei(flustered): "I—" || 俺は……  #c1_0262
natsuki<smirk>: "What are you, {shodan|first dan}?" || 段は？ 初段？  #c1_0180
kohei(smile): "We'll find out on the floor." || 竹刀を交えればわかる。  #c1_0181
natsuki<laugh>: "Big talk for someone who sits like he's being graded." || 審査されてるみたいな座り方してるくせに、言うじゃん。  #c1_0182
kohei(neutral): "Club starts Wednesday." || 部活は水曜からだ。  #c1_0183
natsuki<smile>: "Wednesday." || 水曜日。  #c1_0184
> She takes a ballpoint out of her blazer pocket, turns her left hand over and writes {水|Wednesday} on the inside of her wrist, small, just under her cuff.  #c1_0185
@move natsuki r
@show nanoha school_smile l
nanoha: "Excuse me. Mizuno-san?" || あの……みずのさん？  #c1_0186
> Nanoha's standing by my desk with her lunch held in front of her in both hands, the way she holds things when she's about to do something brave.  #c1_0187
natsuki<surprised>: "Oh—hi. You're…" || あ、どうも。えっと……  #c1_0188
nanoha<smile>: "Tachibana Nanoha. Um— I sit two rows over." || たちばな、なのはです。えっと……二列向こうの席です。  #c1_0189
nanoha<smile>: "If you'd like… I could show you around after school? The library, the music rooms. Which shoe lockers stick. Which vending machine eats coins. That kind of thing." || よかったら……放課後、校内を案内しましょうか？ 図書室とか、音楽室とか。どの下駄箱がひっかかるか。どの自販機がお金を食べるか。そういうのです。  #c1_0190
> For a second Mizuno doesn't say anything.  #c1_0191
natsuki<blush>: "…Really?" || ……ほんとに？  #c1_0192
nanoha<smile>: "It's not a big tour. The vending machine part is the most important." || 大したツアーじゃないですよ。自販機のところが、一番大事です。  #c1_0193
natsuki<smile>: "I'd love that. Which one eats coins?" || うん、ぜひ。で、お金を食べる自販機って、どれ？  #c1_0194
natsuki<smile>: "Oh, and call me Natsuki." || あ、それと、なつきって呼んで。  #c1_0195
nanoha<blush>: "…Natsuki-san." || ……なつき、さん。  #c1_0196
natsuki<surprised>: "Eh, 'san'? We're the same age!" || えー、「さん」？ 同い年じゃん！  #c1_0197
nanoha<smile>: "I'm working up to it." || 段階を踏んでるの。  #c1_0198
natsuki<grin>: "Okay, okay. Then I'll call you Nanoha. All right? I'm doing it anyway." || わかった、わかった。じゃあ、私は「なのは」って呼ぶね。いい？ どっちにしろ呼ぶけど。  #c1_0199
nanoha<blush>: "That's—yes. That's fine." || それは……うん。いいよ。  #c1_0200
> Mizuno laughs, and after a second Nanoha does too, ducking her head over her lunch. The two of them in the window light, over the top of my head. I feel like furniture.  #c1_0201
> I eat my rice. It's good rice. I made it myself.  #c1_0202
