== c1_interlude | Nanoha: the tour
@mode interlude Interlude: Nanoha
@bg bg_classroom_evening
@bgm nanoha
> Natsuki noticed everything.  #c1_0203
> That was the first thing Nanoha learned on the tour. Natsuki noticed that the stairs by the art room squeaked on the fourth step and the eleventh. She noticed that the third-floor girls' bathroom had a window that looked straight at the mountains, and she said "Oh," softly, like she'd been handed something.  #c1_0204
> They ended the tour in their own empty classroom, the evening sun coming in sideways and turning every desk gold. Natsuki leaned back against the desk in front of her own.  #c1_0205
@show natsuki school_smile c
natsuki: "Serious question. Is this building haunted? Something in the music room was knocking." || 真面目に聞くけど。この校舎って、出る？ 音楽室で、なんかコンコン音がしてたんだけど。  #c1_0206
nanoha(smile): "It's old. The pipes sound like a ghost." || 古いからね。配管の音が、おばけみたいなの。  #c1_0207
natsuki<laugh>: "Perfect." || 最高。  #c1_0208
natsuki<curious>: "So. What about you and Fujisawa?" || で。なのはと、ふじさわって？  #c1_0209
nanoha(surprised): "Me and Kōhei?" || 私と、こうへい？  #c1_0210
natsuki<smile>: "You live next door, right? Somebody said." || お隣さんなんでしょ？ 誰かが言ってた。  #c1_0211
nanoha(smile): "Since we were born." || 生まれた時からね。  #c1_0212
natsuki<surprised>: "No way. Real childhood friends? Baby pictures and everything?" || うそ。ほんとの幼なじみ？ 赤ちゃんの頃の写真とかも？  #c1_0213
nanoha(smile): "Real childhood friends." || ほんとの幼なじみ。  #c1_0214
> Nanoha said it as lightly as she knew how. She'd had practice.  #c1_0215
natsuki<wistful>: "I've never stayed anywhere long enough to have one of those. You know? Someone who knows which drawer sticks in your kitchen." || 私、そういうのができるほど、ひとつの場所にいたことないんだ。わかる？ 台所のどの引き出しがひっかかるか、知ってるような人。  #c1_0217
> Nanoha didn't say that Kōhei's kitchen drawer stuck. She didn't say she'd known it since she was six.  #c1_0218
natsuki<smile>: "Hey. Does Fujisawa ever compete up north? Around Sendai?" || ねえ。ふじさわって、東北のほうの大会に出たことある？ 仙台のあたりとか。  #c1_0219
nanoha(surprised): "Not that I know of. Why?" || 聞いたことないけど……どうして？  #c1_0220
natsuki<wistful>: "I feel like I've met him somewhere before. I just can't place it." || どこかで会ったことある気がするんだよね。どこだったか、思い出せないんだけど。  #c1_0221
nanoha(surprised): "…" || -  #c1_0222
nanoha(tease): "I have met him before. Every day. For sixteen years." || 会ったこと、あるよ。毎日。十六年間。  #c1_0223
natsuki<laugh>: "Ha— okay. Then it's his face. He's got kind of a normal one, right? Don't tell him I said that." || あはは、そっか。じゃあ、顔のせいだ。ふじさわって、わりとふつうの顔してるよね？ 本人には内緒ね。  #c1_0224
natsuki<smile>: "Thanks for today, Nanoha. Seriously. First days are usually…" || 今日はありがとね、なのは。ほんとに。転校初日って、いつもは……  #c1_0229
> She didn't finish. She just smiled, and it was a different smile from the one she'd used in front of the class. Smaller. It looked like it cost her something.  #c1_0230
natsuki<wistful>: "Anyway. Thanks." || ……とにかく。ありがと。  #c1_0231
@hide natsuki
> Somewhere between the library and the gym, Nanoha had decided that she liked Mizuno Natsuki.  #c1_0232
> She'd decided it firmly, the way you shut a window against the wind.  #c1_0233
> She did not let herself think about why it had needed deciding at all.  #c1_0234
